					"id": 110133001,
					"content": "#旅行者，派蒙，沒想到{F#妳}{M#你}們居然找到孤雲閣來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133002,
					"content": "有什麼事嗎？我現在很忙，恐怕聊不了太久。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133003,
						110133007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133003,
					"content": "刻晴怎麼在這裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133004
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110133004,
					"content": "#如{F#妳}{M#你}所見，這裡有些工程。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133005,
					"content": "我認為，比起群玉閣，此處的工事更加重要，所以特意過來監督。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133006,
					"content": "希望能趕得上…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133007,
					"content": "這個是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133008
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110133008,
					"content": "這是新式歸終機。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133009,
					"content": "凝光命專人拆解研究歸終機，以此為藍本設計出了改良圖紙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133010,
					"content": "相比仙人製造的原版歸終機，這一款的射速與威力都稍遜一籌，但勝在可以量產。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133011,
					"content": "而且拆卸和組裝都十分方便，可以靈活部署到各個地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133012,
					"content": "相信它會是應對危機的良策。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				}
			]
		},
